From a645cf4f602af52c1c7ab4b6021d19fa49688ae5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiaoliang Yang <xiaoliang.yang_1@nxp.com>
Date: Tue, 26 May 2026 17:31:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] lldpd: add additional ethernet capabilities tlv

Additional Ethernet capabilities TLV is defined in IEEE Std 802.3-2018.
Its subtype is 7, and the first 4 bits indicate preemption capability
and status. Get the preemption status from ethtool in Linux. Disable or
enable the preemption when detected the link partner preemption status.

Signed-off-by: Xiaoliang Yang <xiaoliang.yang_1@nxp.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
